1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
No signal. Halfway up the mountain. Now what?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Meet Tahak.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
It packs a whole mountain into your phone
before you leave home.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
An offline map with the Trail, where you are
and the next Waypoint.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Wander off the Trail and it tells you
which way to go back.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Ask in English, Filipino or Taglish.
The AI runs on the phone itself.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,000
In an emergency it never guesses.
It opens a first-aid Guide.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
And if you need to be found, fire the Flare.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Tahak. When the signal drops, your guide doesn't.
